sequenceDiagram
    participant Judge
    participant FastAPI
    participant ReportJob
    participant SummarizationPipeline
    participant CaseReasonerPipeline
    participant MongoDB

    Judge->>FastAPI: POST /api/v1/cases/{case_id}/reports/generate
    FastAPI->>MongoDB: verify case exists + documents > 0
    MongoDB-->>FastAPI: ok
    FastAPI->>MongoDB: create_report_job (status: pending)
    MongoDB-->>FastAPI: job_id
    FastAPI-->>Judge: HTTP 202 + job_id

    FastAPI->>ReportJob: start background task (case_id, job_id)
    ReportJob->>MongoDB: update job status → running

    ReportJob->>SummarizationPipeline: run(case_id, documents)
    SummarizationPipeline->>SummarizationPipeline: 7-node pipeline
    SummarizationPipeline->>MongoDB: upsert summaries
    SummarizationPipeline-->>ReportJob: case_brief + rendered_brief

    ReportJob->>CaseReasonerPipeline: run_case_reasoning(case_brief, rendered_brief, case_id)
    CaseReasonerPipeline->>CaseReasonerPipeline: issue extraction + branch analyses
    CaseReasonerPipeline->>MongoDB: upsert case_reasonings
    CaseReasonerPipeline-->>ReportJob: CaseReasoningResult

    ReportJob->>MongoDB: update job status → completed

    loop Judge polling
        Judge->>FastAPI: GET /api/v1/cases/{case_id}/reports/{report_id}
        FastAPI->>MongoDB: fetch job status
        alt completed
            MongoDB-->>FastAPI: status=completed
            FastAPI->>MongoDB: fetch summary + case_reasoning
            MongoDB-->>FastAPI: summary + reasoning docs
            FastAPI-->>Judge: status + summary + case_reasoning
        else pending or running
            MongoDB-->>FastAPI: status=pending|running
            FastAPI-->>Judge: status only
        else failed
            MongoDB-->>FastAPI: status=failed + error
            FastAPI-->>Judge: status + error message
        end
    end
